{"id":"mahabharata-4-003","work":"mahabharata","part":4,"partName":"विराटपर्व","partNameEn":"Virata Parva","unit":3,"title":"तृतीयोऽध्यायः","titleEn":"Adhyaya 3 · The twins and Draupadi choose theirs","summary":{"en":"Nakula will be Granthika, keeper of the king's horses, and Sahadeva Tantipala, keeper of his cattle. Draupadi says she will serve Queen Sudeshna as a sairandhri, a maid skilled in dressing hair, and Yudhishthira praises her words.","kn":"ನಕುಲನು ರಾಜನ ಕುದುರೆಗಳ ಪಾಲಕ ಗ್ರಂಥಿಕನೂ, ಸಹದೇವನು ಗೋಪಾಲಕ ತಂತಿಪಾಲನೂ ಆಗುತ್ತಾರೆ. ತಾನು ಕೇಶಾಲಂಕಾರದಲ್ಲಿ ನಿಪುಣ ಸೈರಂಧ್ರಿಯಾಗಿ ಸುದೇಷ್ಣಾ ರಾಣಿಯ ಸೇವೆ ಮಾಡುವೆನೆಂದು ದ್ರೌಪದಿ ಹೇಳುತ್ತಾಳೆ, ಯುಧಿಷ್ಠಿರನು ಅವಳ ಮಾತನ್ನು ಹೊಗಳುತ್ತಾನೆ.","hi":"नकुल राजा के घोड़ों के रक्षक ग्रन्थिक बनेंगे और सहदेव गौओं के रक्षक तन्तिपाल। द्रौपदी कहती हैं कि वे केश-सज्जा में निपुण सैरन्ध्री बनकर रानी सुदेष्णा की सेवा करेंगी, और युधिष्ठिर उनके वचनों की प्रशंसा करते हैं।","te":"నకులుడు రాజు గుర్రాల రక్షకుడు గ్రంథికుడుగా, సహదేవుడు గోపాలకుడు తంతిపాలుడుగా ఉంటారు. తాను కేశాలంకరణలో నిపుణురాలైన సైరంధ్రిగా సుదేష్ణ రాణికి సేవ చేస్తానని ద్రౌపది చెబుతుంది, యుధిష్ఠిరుడు ఆమె మాటలను కొనియాడతాడు.","ta":"நகுலன் மன்னனின் குதிரைகளைக் காக்கும் க்ரந்திகனாகவும், ஸஹதேவன் பசுக்களைக் காக்கும் தந்திபாலனாகவும் இருப்பார்கள். தான் கூந்தல் அலங்காரத்தில் வல்ல ஸைரந்த்ரியாக ஸுதேஷ்ணை அரசிக்குப் பணிவிடை செய்வேன் என்று திரௌபதி சொல்ல, யுதிஷ்டிரர் அவள் சொல்லைப் புகழ்கிறார்.","ml":"നകുലൻ ഗ്രന്ഥികൻ എന്ന പേരിൽ രാജാവിന്റെ കുതിരകളെയും സഹദേവൻ തന്തിപാലൻ എന്ന പേരിൽ പശുക്കളെയും നോക്കും. സുദേഷ്ണ രാജ്ഞിയെ സേവിക്കുമെന്ന് ദ്രൗപദി പറയുന്നു; മുടി ചമയ്ക്കുന്നതിൽ മിടുക്കിയായ സൈരന്ധ്രിയായി അവർ കഴിയും. യുധിഷ്ഠിരൻ അവളുടെ വാക്കുകളെ പ്രശംസിക്കുന്നു."},"source":"Mahabharata, Critical Edition (BORI, Pune) 4.3; e-text by M. Tokunaga and J. D. Smith, © BORI 1999, version of Thu Dec  1 2011","sections":[{"title":"वैराटपर्व","titleEn":"Vairata Parva (At Virata's court)","verses":[{"text":"युधिष्ठिर उवाच","meaning":{"en":"Yudhishthira said:"}},{"n":1,"text":"किं त्वं नकुल कुर्वाणस्तत्र तात चरिष्यसि ।\nसुकुमारश्च शूरश्च दर्शनीयः सुखोचितः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Nakula, dear brother, what work will you do there? You are delicate and brave, handsome and used to comfort."}},{"text":"नकुल उवाच","meaning":{"en":"Nakula said:"}},{"n":2,"text":"अश्वबन्धो भविष्यामि विराटनृपतेरहम् ।\nग्रन्थिको नाम नाम्नाहं कर्मैतत्सुप्रियं मम ॥","meaning":{"en":"I shall be a keeper of horses for King Virata, under the name Granthika; this work is very dear to me."}},{"n":3,"text":"कुशलोऽस्म्यश्वशिक्षायां तथैवाश्वचिकित्सिते ।\nप्रियाश्च सततं मेऽश्वाः कुरुराज यथा तव ॥","meaning":{"en":"I am skilled in training horses and likewise in treating them, and horses are always dear to me, O king of the Kurus, as they are to you."}},{"n":4,"text":"ये मामामन्त्रयिष्यन्ति विराटनगरे जनाः ।\nतेभ्य एवं प्रवक्ष्यामि विहरिष्याम्यहं यथा ॥","meaning":{"en":"To the people in Virata's city who ask me about myself, I shall say this, and so I shall pass the time."}},{"text":"युधिष्ठिर उवाच","meaning":{"en":"Yudhishthira said:"}},{"n":5,"text":"सहदेव कथं तस्य समीपे विहरिष्यसि ।\nकिं वा त्वं तात कुर्वाणः प्रच्छन्नो विचरिष्यसि ॥","meaning":{"en":"Sahadeva, how will you live near him? Or what work will you do to move about unnoticed, dear brother?"}},{"text":"सहदेव उवाच","meaning":{"en":"Sahadeva said:"}},{"n":6,"text":"गोसंख्याता भविष्यामि विराटस्य महीपतेः ।\nप्रतिषेद्धा च दोग्धा च संख्याने कुशलो गवाम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"I shall be the cattle-counter of King Virata, one who holds back the cows and milks them, skilled in counting herds."}},{"n":7,"text":"तन्तिपाल इति ख्यातो नाम्ना विदितमस्तु ते ।\nनिपुणं च चरिष्यामि व्येतु ते मानसो ज्वरः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Know my name to be Tantipala; I shall go about my work skillfully, so let the fever of worry leave your mind."}},{"n":8,"text":"अहं हि भवता गोषु सततं प्रकृतः पुरा ।\nतत्र मे कौशलं कर्म अवबुद्धं विशां पते ॥","meaning":{"en":"For you always set me over the cattle in the past, and so my skill in that work is known to you, lord of the people."}},{"n":9,"text":"लक्षणं चरितं चापि गवां यच्चापि मङ्गलम् ।\nतत्सर्वं मे सुविदितमन्यच्चापि महीपते ॥","meaning":{"en":"I know well the signs, the habits and the auspicious marks of cows, and much else besides, O king."}},{"n":10,"text":"वृषभानपि जानामि राजन्पूजितलक्षणान् ।\nयेषां मूत्रमुपाघ्राय अपि वन्ध्या प्रसूयते ॥","meaning":{"en":"I also know the bulls with excellent marks, whose urine, merely smelled, makes even a barren cow bear a calf."}},{"n":11,"text":"सोऽहमेवं चरिष्यामि प्रीतिरत्र हि मे सदा ।\nन च मां वेत्स्यति परस्तत्ते रोचतु पार्थिव ॥","meaning":{"en":"So I shall live, for I always take pleasure in this work, and no one else will recognize me; let this please you, king."}},{"text":"युधिष्ठिर उवाच","meaning":{"en":"Yudhishthira said:"}},{"n":12,"text":"इयं तु नः प्रिया भार्या प्राणेभ्योऽपि गरीयसी ।\nमातेव परिपाल्या च पूज्या ज्येष्ठेव च स्वसा ॥","meaning":{"en":"But this is our beloved wife, dearer than our lives; she must be protected like a mother and honored like an elder sister."}},{"n":13,"text":"केन स्म कर्मणा कृष्णा द्रौपदी विचरिष्यति ।\nन हि किंचिद्विजानाति कर्म कर्तुं यथा स्त्रियः ॥","meaning":{"en":"By what work will Draupadi Krishna live? She knows no work as women do."}},{"n":14,"text":"सुकुमारी च बाला च राजपुत्री यशस्विनी ।\nपतिव्रता महाभागा कथं नु विचरिष्यति ॥","meaning":{"en":"She is delicate and young, a famous princess, devoted to her husbands and most fortunate; how will she manage?"}},{"n":15,"text":"माल्यगन्धानलंकारान्वस्त्राणि विविधानि च ।\nएतान्येवाभिजानाति यतो जाता हि भामिनी ॥","meaning":{"en":"This lady knows only garlands, perfumes, ornaments and various garments, being born as she was."}},{"text":"द्रौपद्युवाच","meaning":{"en":"Draupadi said:"}},{"n":16,"text":"सैरन्ध्र्योऽरक्षिता लोके भुजिष्याः सन्ति भारत ।\nनैवमन्याः स्त्रियो यान्ति इति लोकस्य निश्चयः ॥","meaning":{"en":"There are women known as sairandhris who work in other people's houses and are free to go about; such women are not guarded, and people know this."}},{"n":17,"text":"साहं ब्रुवाणा सैरन्ध्री कुशला केशकर्मणि ।\nआत्मगुप्ता चरिष्यामि यन्मां त्वमनुपृच्छसि ॥","meaning":{"en":"I shall say I am a sairandhri, skilled in dressing hair, and I shall protect myself as I live there, since you ask me."}},{"n":18,"text":"सुदेष्णां प्रत्युपस्थास्ये राजभार्यां यशस्विनीम् ।\nसा रक्षिष्यति मां प्राप्तां मा ते भूद्दुःखमीदृशम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"I shall attend Sudeshna, the king's famous wife, and she will protect me when I come to her; let no such sorrow come to you."}},{"text":"युधिष्ठिर उवाच","meaning":{"en":"Yudhishthira said:"}},{"n":19,"text":"कल्याणं भाषसे कृष्णे कुले जाता यथा वदेत् ।\nन पापमभिजानासि साधु साध्वीव्रते स्थिता ॥","meaning":{"en":"You speak well, Krishna, as one born of a good family would; you know nothing of evil, virtuous woman, and you stand firm in your vow."}}]}]}